## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Decisions & Requirements:**
> 1. **SMS Gateway:** We will proceed with Kavenegar as the default primary SMS provider, with interface contracts allowing easy swap-out to Faraz SMS or SMS.ir.
> 2. **Object Storage Provider:** We will write the configuration template to support ArvanCloud or ParsPack S3-compatible object storage via custom S3 endpoints.
> 3. **Dynamic Watermarking Format:** To prevent piracy on domestic platforms (like Telegram or Rubika), cards will render the student's obfuscated phone number (e.g., `0912***3456`) and registration ID diagonally with 0.08 opacity.

