## Proposed Changes

### Documentation & Security Design

---

#### [NEW] [security_design.md](file:///e:/projects/leitner-learning-platform/docs/security/security_design.md)
Create a comprehensive Security Design Document detailing:
- **Course & Local Encryption Strategy:**
  - AES-256 block encryption via SQLCipher for the client database.
  - Client-side key derivation combined with system Keystore/Keychain integration and custom software-encryption fallback for budget devices.
  - Course ZIP archive extraction and decryption mechanisms.
- **API Security:**
  - JWT token flow (RS256/HS256) with short-lived access tokens (15m) and long-lived refresh tokens (30d).
  - RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) structure (Admin vs Student permissions).
  - Rate limiting architecture using Redis-backed rate limiting middleware.
- **Iran-Specific Infrastructure Integration:**
  - SMS Gateway implementation contracts (Kavenegar default).
  - CAPTCHA flow design (self-hosted / domestic fallback).
  - Payment integration contracts (ZarinPal v4 & Cafe Bazaar/Myket IAP).
- **Anti-Piracy:**
  - Dynamic overlay watermarking algorithm (obfuscated student phone + student ID on UI).
  - Signed temporary download URLs with short time-to-live (10 minutes) verified by backend purchase checks using domestic S3/CDN endpoints.
- **Off-Server Backup & Replication:**
  - Architecture for immediate replication of user registration and purchase data using domestic S3-compatible targets.
  - SQL dump automation and retention schedule (daily/weekly/monthly).
- **Secrets Management:**
  - Environment configuration standards and templates.

